If you mean combining entries with the same lower subscript, the shown approach is to group them with Gather and then Total each group:

t = Transpose[{x[#] & /@ Range[20], RandomInteger[15, 20]}];
d = Subscript[#[[1]], #[[2]]] & /@ t;
Total /@ Gather[d, #1[[2]] == #2[[2]] &]

