For example, instead of `a[1], b[1], ...`, use:

```mathematica
cf = Compile[{{data, _Real, 1}},
  Module[{x, a, b},
    x = Last@data;
    a = data[[1 ;; -2 ;; 2]];
    b = data[[2 ;; -2 ;; 2]];
    a.Sin[b + x]
