A fast Mathematica-only export is:

writeYourCSV[file_String, list_List?MatrixQ] :=
  With[{str = OpenWrite[file, PageWidth -> Infinity], len = Length[list[[1]]]},
    Scan[
      Write[str,
        Sequence @@ (Flatten[Table[{FortranForm[#[[i]]], OutputForm[","]}, {i, len - 1}]]) ~Join~ {FortranForm[#[[len]]]}] &,
      list
    ];
    Close[str];
  ]

This avoids the extra blank lines seen with the ExportString/Table approach.

