The supported approach is to avoid a single automatic Plot3D grid and instead build a custom grid with finer sampling near the important features and coarser sampling elsewhere. In the related case, the method was:

- identify the boundary where the function hits a chosen cutoff and the ridge/minimum line you want to emphasize;
- switch to polar coordinates centered on the data;
- use interpolation to trace those lines;
- generate a tailored sampling grid.

