For example:

```wolfram
dint = Interpolation[data];
slope = dint';

With[{x = .003, h = 800},
 y = dint[x];
 dir = Normalize[{1, slope[x]}]/2;
 ListLinePlot[data, Epilog -> Line[{{x, y} - h dir, {x, y} + h dir}]]
]
```

If you want multiple tangents, use the same construction for each x-value.

