Use `InputField` with a `Dynamic` string variable for each field, and give each one its own symbol so you can name and manipulate them separately. For example, in a `DynamicModule` you might use `input1`, `input2`, etc. If you want Return to insert a newline, wrap each field in `EventHandler` and handle `"ReturnKeyDown"`.

